      "content": "but what if there isn't a new meaning? i've tried thinking about it that way, but it feels fake. like you're just trying to put a happy spin on a tragedy. when a career ends like mine did, the purpose is just gone. it's like being a character in a movie after the credits have rolled and the screen has gone black. i'm just sitting there in the dark, waiting for something that's never coming back. doesn't it seem more logical to just accept that the best part is over?",
